    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        167.8762969970703,
        501.6614990234375,
        197.89230346679688,
        512.2135009765625
      ],
      "text": "(n = 16)",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Bold",
      "size": 8.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        549.794921875,
        527.5068969726562,
        564.2379150390625
      ],
      "text": "No RCTs were found. All the studies included were observational, and no studies of resource",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        562.994873046875,
        527.5458984375,
        577.4378662109375
      ],
      "text": "requirements, feasibility or impact on equity were found. Four of the 16 studies included efficacy: one",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.99034595489502,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        576.1948852539062,
        527.444580078125,
        590.6378784179688
      ],
      "text": "with MFX or ofloxacin (OFX) monotherapy, two with Lfx or MFX with a companion drug (ETH, EMB",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        589.3948974609375,
        527.4057006835938,
        603.837890625
      ],
      "text": "or PZA and one with standard INH therapy. Five studies reported on safety outcomes, four of which",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        602.5949096679688,
        527.3827514648438,
        617.0379028320312
      ],
      "text": "were of children and adolescents and one of adult contacts. Six studies reported the acceptability",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        615.794921875,
        527.59375,
        630.2379150390625
      ],
      "text": "of FQ-based TPT; five reported quantitative measures and one the qualitative acceptability of a",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        628.994873046875,
        527.3783569335938,
        643.4378662109375
      ],
      "text": "novel paediatric Lfx formulation to caregivers and child contacts. One study evaluated the global",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        642.1948852539062,
        527.3213500976562,
        656.6378784179688
      ],
      "text": "cost-effectiveness of providing Lfx to HHCs < 15 years. The studies included were too disparate",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        655.3948974609375,
        527.5936279296875,
        669.837890625
      ],
      "text": "to allow any pooling of results or meta-analyses. Therefore, the results below reflect non-pooled",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        668.5948486328125,
        527.37060546875,
        683.037841796875
      ],
      "text": "findings. The protocol of this systematic review was registered on Prospero on 23 September 2023",
